Polygon closes its Coinme deal and becomes a regulated US payments business

@0xPolygon now holds 37 US state licenses to move money, plus 11 exemptions, covering 48 states in total, and is registered with FinCEN. It all plugs into Polygon’s Open Money Stack.

Tazapay, Mesh, Toku, and Kira are among the first businesses using it for cross-border payments, account funding, global payroll, and US dollar access.

